---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro';
import ServiceInquiry from '../components/ServiceInquiry.astro';
import { site, hasServerForm } from '../lib/site';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Choose a $400 service and tell Force Multiplier about your small business. Review the scope and separate costs before deciding."
  path="/contact"
>
  <section class="page-intro contact-intro wrap">
    <h1>Let’s talk<br />about the work.</h1><p class="lead">
      Tell us what you do, what you are trying to change and where you could use a hand. A short
      note is enough.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap contact-grid section-bottom">
    <div>
      {hasServerForm ? <InquiryForm /> : <ServiceInquiry allowUndecided />}
    </div><aside class="contact-side">
      <h2>Prefer to reach out directly?</h2><a class="email" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}
        >{site.email}</a
      ><hr /><h2>A useful first note</h2><ul>
        <li>What your business does</li><li>Where things are getting stuck</li><li>
          What a better result would look like
        </li><li>Any timing or constraints that matter</li>
      </ul><hr /><h2>Local roots. National reach.</h2><p class="small">
        Based in Monroe, Louisiana. We work remotely with small businesses nationwide. Contact and
        business-number integration are being reviewed before launch.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section class="section pale-section">
    <div class="wrap faq-section">
      <h2>Before we talk.</h2><details>
        <summary>Do I need to know which service I need?</summary><p>
          No. Describe the situation in your own words. The first job is to understand the problem,
          then work out which kind of help fits.
        </p>
      </details><details>
        <summary>How is the work priced?</summary><p>
          Each catalog service is $400 under a separate agreement. Recurring services are
          month-to-month; one-time projects are paid once. We confirm scope and separate
          advertising, software and other third-party costs before you approve.
        </p>
      </details><details>
        <summary>Can you work with our current tools or website?</summary><p>
          Yes. We start by looking at what is already in place. Sometimes the right next step is a
          focused improvement; sometimes the underlying setup needs more attention.
        </p>
      </details><details>
        <summary>Do you guarantee a number of leads?</summary><p>
          No. We focus on the parts that affect visibility, customer fit and follow-through, and
          agree on a practical way to measure the work.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
